  "title": "Between The Lecture Theatre And The Trenches Members Of Eth Zurich Involved In The First World War",
  "language": "en",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "The ETH Zurich University Archives will be presenting its resources on the subject of \"Zwischen Hörsaal und Schützengraben: ETH-Angehörige im Ersten Weltkrieg\" (Between the lecture theatre and the trenches: members of ETH Zurich involved in the First World War). The tour will be in German. Meeting point: ETH-Bibliothek, circulation desk ( main building , floor H). No registration necessary.\n\nDr Roman Rossfeld will make an appearance at the evening tour as a specialist in the history of the First World War."
    }
  ],
